      {
        "id": 145162,
        "name": "Blossercubbles",
        "username": "Blossercubbles",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/blossercubbles/{size}/1863_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-21T02:31:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Now that I live in Indianapolis, there's no excuse to not be there. And, much like the past two years, I'll be part of the GtG helper crew!</p><p>There are a few costume-based things I'll be doing at the convention, but none are Sentinels based. Hopefully it doesn't cause anyone confusion when Velma is teaching them a game just to be eaten alive the next day by Adagio McSingsalot.</p><p>I'd say I'm pretty excited for this year's Con, due to actually signing up for things to do. I usually work, walk, and watch the speed painting competition, especially when Malifaux is featured.</p>",
