        "id": 145165,
        "name": "Animus",
        "username": "Animus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/animus/{size}/1887_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-22T11:43:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello everybody!</p><p>My name is Ron. I'm new to the forums, but have been a fan of Sentinels for a little while. Truth be told, I didn't delve into the storyline until recently, though. What took me so long?!&nbsp;</p><p>Anyway, I will be at Gen Con Thursday through Saturday. Mostly I'll be playing D&amp;D 5e and be at Games on Demand GMing or playing, or I will be wandering the dealer hall. I would LOVE to meet some people. Is anyone playing a meetup at the con to play some games?</p>",
