        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-23T15:09:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Craig\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/48/2150_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Craig:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>PlatinumWarlock wrote:</b><br><blockquote>There's a &gt;G side room? &nbsp;Where at and when?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nRoom 144. It'll be open from 9am to late at night.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>144?! &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The tactics tournaments and SotM RPG demos are all listed in 237-238. Is the side room different then where the tactics tournament and SotM RPG demos will be run?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>Tactics tournaments</div><div>THU &nbsp; &nbsp; 10am &nbsp; &nbsp;4pm &nbsp; Tactics Qualifier (BGM1577297, ICC 237-238, $0)</div><div>THU &nbsp; &nbsp; 3pm &nbsp; &nbsp; 9pm &nbsp; Tactics Qualifier (BGM1577298, ICC 237-238, $0)</div><div>FRI &nbsp; &nbsp; 1pm &nbsp; &nbsp; 8pm &nbsp; Tactics Qual Semis/Finals (BGM1577299, ICC 237-238, $0)</div><div>SAT &nbsp; &nbsp; 10am &nbsp; &nbsp;5pm &nbsp; Tactics Champ Semis (BCM1577307, ICC 237-238, $0)</div><div>SUN &nbsp; &nbsp; 10am &nbsp; &nbsp;2pm &nbsp; Tactics Champ Finals (BCM1577301, ICC 237-238, $0)</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><div>Thu 7/30</div><div> 1pm &nbsp; &nbsp; 3pm &nbsp; SoTM RPG Demo (RPG1577302, ICC 237-238, $0) </div><div>&nbsp;</div></div><div>&nbsp;</div>",
